---
const faqs=[['Why Astro instead of React?','This site is content-first and animation-heavy, not state-heavy. Astro keeps the output lean while still giving us a component system.'],['Is GSAP required?','For the cinematic scroll behavior we are targeting, GSAP + ScrollTrigger gives us predictable timelines, pinning and responsive control.'],['Will mobile use the same animations?','Not always. Heavy horizontal/pinned effects can become simpler stacked interactions on small screens for usability and performance.'],['Can this later move into Laravel?','Yes. The visual system and motion logic can be ported section by section; the current build avoids framework-specific UI state.']];
---
<section class="section pricing" id="pricing"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow reveal">Starter direction</span><h2 class="section-title reveal">Fast foundation now. Easy to extend later.</h2><div class="price-grid"><article class="price-panel reveal"><div><span class="pill">Recommended stack</span><h3>Astro + GSAP</h3><p>Static-first rendering, custom CSS, isolated animation modules and optional progressive enhancements.</p></div><ul><li>Astro components</li><li>GSAP + ScrollTrigger</li><li>Custom responsive CSS</li><li>No React runtime by default</li><li>Accessible reduced-motion fallback</li></ul><a class="btn" href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></article><article class="code-panel reveal"><div class="code-head"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>motion.js</span></div><pre><code>gsap.to(track, &#123;
  x: () =&gt; -(track.scrollWidth - innerWidth),
  ease: "none",
  scrollTrigger: &#123;
    trigger: shell,
    pin: true,
    scrub: 1
  &#125;
&#125;);</code></pre></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section faq" id="faq"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span><h2 class="section-title reveal">Technical decisions, kept simple.</h2><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details class="faq-item reveal"><summary>{q}<span>+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<style>
.price-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:18px;margin-top:54px}.price-panel,.code-panel{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:32px;background:#101011;min-height:520px}.price-panel{padding:38px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.pill{display:inline-flex;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(103,255,154,.35);color:var(--green);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.price-panel h3{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5.4rem);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:18px 0 8px}.price-panel p{color:var(--muted);max-width:580px}.price-panel ul{padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px}.price-panel li::before{content:'✓';color:var(--green);margin-right:10px}.code-panel{overflow:hidden;background:#0b0b0c}.code-head{height:62px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 22px;gap:8px}.code-head i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#3a3a3f}.code-head i:first-child{background:var(--red)}.code-head span{margin-left:auto;color:#6f6f75;font-size:.8rem}.code-panel pre{margin:0;padding:45px 34px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.6vw,1.2rem);color:#d7d7dc;line-height:1.8}.faq-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:48px}.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:0}.faq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.3vw,1.8rem);font-weight:700;padding:25px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-item summary span{color:var(--red);font-size:1.8rem;transition:.2s}.faq-item[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.faq-item p{color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;margin:0 0 28px}
@media(max-width:800px){.price-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.price-panel,.code-panel{min-height:440px}}
</style>
